WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:50.150
Someone once said...

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.960
There are eggs as fresh as grains of rice,

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:56.220
that grow in abundance on ears of rice...

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.530
Riceggs!

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.100
When they're spawned, giant, 
first-rate herring roe

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.070
are like corn on the cob...

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.370
Herring Kelp Corn!

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:15.640
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:21.980
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:28.260
Aiming to obtain Mellow 
Cola, Toriko and Zebra

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.060
battled the Salamander Sphinx 
while following the directions

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:34.360
of Komatsu, who deciphered the ancient text.

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:40.430
Let's begin preparing Mellow Cola!

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.820
They were successful at last, as Mellow Cola

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:01.520
came out of the body of 
the Salamander Sphinx...

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:12.200
But then a mysterious creature 
appeared and pierced Komatsu's body.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:26.440
Toriko and Zebra also suffered a lot 
of damage from the creature's attacks.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.710
On top of that, it stole 
all of the Mellow Cola.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:36.620
However, Zebra's fury 
replenished all of his energy.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.860
Toriko's autophagy was triggered too

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.200
and they both challenged the 
mysterious creature to a battle.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.780
Explosion of Combination Techniques!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.580
We Get the World's Best Cola!

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:23.300
President, about that birdman-like 
thing you sent over earlier...

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:27.040
It's wreaking havoc.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:29.140
What the hell is that thing?

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:33.240
The existence of that creature

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:37.780
was first confirmed by Acacia.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.660
Incredible...

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:51.530
It's eating a Poison Boar without 
letting it become poisonous.

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:58.030
It's a feat that's only possible

00:04:58.630 --> 00:04:59.900
with vast strength and intelligence.

00:05:12.280 --> 00:05:13.920
I never knew such a creature existed...

00:05:14.680 --> 00:05:16.720
It needs to be thoroughly studied.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:22.220
Acacia learned

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:26.690
that creature held the key 
to getting closer to GOD.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.060
Also...

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.570
...he learned about its 
astonishing way of life

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.870
and entrusted his disciple, me,

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:38.970
with isolating and observing the 
creatures all over the world.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:43.540
To think, Acacia, the "Gourmet 
God", has a connection with it...

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.220
But why is it being so violent?

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.650
Something may be happening...

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.930
Meteor Noise!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.110
17-fold...

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.580
...Spiked Punch!

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.060
You're annoyingly loud!

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:09.860
Voice Missile!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.830
Missile!

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.430
Missile!

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:17.030
Missile!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.450
I'm not done yet.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:44.590
Zebra!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:47.760
How...? That was a Spiked Punch...

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.900
It learned that just from seeing it?

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:54.440
I get it...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.210
I thought I saw you somewhere before.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.170
Now I remember!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.050
There was one of you locked up 
in the Gourmet Prison recently.

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:04.450
You're exactly alike.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:06.820
That one was still a kid,

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:09.280
but according to the Warden,

00:08:09.850 --> 00:08:12.320
it was really tough.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.160
Zebra!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.190
My autophagy won't last much longer.

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:21.300
The same probably goes for 
your rage-fueled recovery.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.730
We don't have time.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.670
Let's finish this with a combo attack!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.300
A combo attack?

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:32.370
Like we used to do!

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:35.510
I forgot about that.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:44.450
Flying Fork!

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.730
Machine Gun Voice!

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.300
Leg Fork!

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.780
Leg Knife!

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.380
The thing's tough! But in that case...

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:19.990
17-fold...

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.260
...Spiked Punch!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.600
It's damn quick...

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.900
I guess only attacks movin' at the 
speed of sound will do the trick.

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.340
It should be about ready...

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.840
Alright, come down...

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.910
Meteor Noise!

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:09.330
Impossible...

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:12.770
It dodged that attack by a hair's breadth?!

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.050
No more time. This is the last one...

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:28.850
Attack at the same time I punch, Zebra!

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.400
Got it.

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:43.330
But in return,

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:46.440
you better not miss!

00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:52.640
Sound Wall!

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:57.650
17-fold Supersonic Spiked Punch!

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:03.050
Zebra-san...

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.820
I also have a condition!

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:09.690
What, another one?

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:14.400
Please, do your best to 
cooperate with Toriko-san.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:15.860
Please!

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:18.630
Yeah, fine!

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:23.000
I made a promise...

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:26.510
...so I ain't gonna screw around an' lie.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.030
H-How tough is this guy?!

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:25.000
It took that punch head-on...

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.700
But it ends here...

00:12:29.440 --> 00:12:32.640
Pretty soon, its life will rot away.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:33.870
Zebra...

00:12:35.410 --> 00:12:39.610
Sure, Coco can see the shadow 
of death on a creature,

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:46.050
but I've killed too many 
creatures to count...

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:52.360
Somewhere along the line, I've become 
able to hear the Grim Reaper's footsteps.

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:59.330
I don't think this guy will 
live more than a few days.

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:03.170
For givin' us such a fun battle,

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:05.840
I'll show my thanks by lettin' 
it hear something special.

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:11.180
I'll turn the Grim Reaper's 
footsteps into "voice".

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.220
Death Sound...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.840
That's what you get for bein' cocky.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:51.380
Still, that may not have been a 
creature from the Human World.

00:13:51.880 --> 00:13:55.950
Yeah. I can't believe a 
creature like this existed.

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:01.220
I saw one that looked like 
this once, above the clouds,

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:04.690
and that was really mysterious, too.

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.600
What sticks in my mind is its ferocity.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.900
I bet it came from hunger.

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:17.070
It was unusually desperate, as 
if it hadn't eaten for hundreds,

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:20.840
no, thousands or tens of thousands of years.

00:14:21.310 --> 00:14:23.150
Tens of thousands of years...

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:27.980
It's hard to imagine something being 
alive that long without eating anything.

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:38.090
What?! Still alive?!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:39.960
What?! This is still alive?!

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:41.800
No, not this.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:46.840
There's another guy we 
thought was dead, remember?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:55.380
K-Komatsu!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.050
Are you okay, Komatsu?!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.290
Komatsu!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:14.360
T-Toriko-san...

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:21.400
Just in case, right when we were about 
to tangle with that Salamander thing,

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:27.940
I cloaked you with Sound Armor 
that was stronger than before.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:36.580
Even so, after that creature's powerful 
attack, I just about wrote you off, kid.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:41.890
Zebra-san... Th-Thank you!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:48.190
Oh, that's right! The cola... What 
happened to the Mellow Cola...?

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.370
Toriko-san! Zebra-san?!

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:59.170
M-My autophagy is about to hit a wall...

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:03.510
Me too. I think my voice 
is gonna give out again.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.450
I'm sorry, Komatsu.

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.950
After everything we went through 
to get it out, the Mellow Cola...

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:16.250
It was all stolen by that thing.

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.330
After all you did to direct us...

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:24.560
Toriko-san, um, where is the 
Beast that released the cola?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.230
Over there...

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:33.740
There's more...

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.470
More?!

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:39.880
What comes out at first is harsh,

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:43.780
oxidized cola that had built up 
on the surface of the tear gland.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:47.350
Of course, that's wonderful cola too,

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.660
but the cola that comes out afterwards 
is the really mellow stuff.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.760
Why hasn't it come out yet?

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.160
It's the amount!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:01.700
The volume of real cola is 
tens or hundreds of times more

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.370
than what first came out.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:10.010
If it <i>had</i> come out already, this 
whole area would be a pool of cola!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.340
Th-Then...

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:23.890
The tears that are about to 
overflow are the real Mellow Cola!

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:45.540
A-Amazing carbonation! It sounds like 
firecrackers and feels invigorating!

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:49.680
All the blood in my body 
is speeding up at once!

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.480
So this is Mellow Cola, huh?!

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.920
It feels so refreshing!

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:00.720
The three of us got this together.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:07.030
Thank you, Komatsu, Zebra, 
and you, Salamander Sphinx!

00:18:08.030 --> 00:18:12.700
I give thanks for this world's bounty.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:41.230
Delicious!

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.470
What overwhelming sweetness!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.370
It's hundreds of times more 
sugary than maple syrup

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:53.010
and slowly permeates every inch of my body!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:58.980
And champagne and club soda can't 
compare to its intense carbonation!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:04.320
Every cell in my body is being 
shaken awake simultaneously!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:09.720
And a kind, refreshing feeling is 
spreading throughout my whole body!

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:14.330
The sweetness throughout my 
body keeps going on and on!

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.400
It's so delicious!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.170
So this is the world's best cola!

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.140
What an incredible presence!

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:30.940
I used up all my strength, but suddenly 
my body's filled with energy!

00:19:31.610 --> 00:19:39.480
No, that ain't all! My cells are evolvin'!

00:19:39.980 --> 00:19:43.550
The apex of the Gourmet Pyramid, 
the Salamander Sphinx...

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:48.190
We've been given a boon by all of 
the creatures in this ecosystem!

00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:49.590
Yes, that's right!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.830
Look! It looks so happy!

00:19:56.100 --> 00:20:00.670
Well, sure! I bet it feels good to let 
out what it had stored up so long.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:03.710
I've decided.

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:10.410
I'm gonna put this Mellow 
Cola on my Full Course menu.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:22.030
Drink
Mellow Cola Capture Level: 92

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.860
Well, kid?

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:31.700
Now you're gonna be my partner, right?

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.170
What?!

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.250
We give thanks for this food, let's eat!

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:50.090
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.820
Potassium, manganese, calcium, 
starch, fructose, and dextrose

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:55.660
Magnesium, iron, vitamins ABCDE

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:58.490
Vanadium, sodium, glucosamine, chondroitin

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:01.330
Carotintintin, lycopenpenpene, 
isoflavonvonvone

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:04.070
Celery, goya, and green peas

00:21:04.070 --> 00:21:06.870
Shiitake, liver, eggplant, bell pepper

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:09.570
What a shame to say "I don't 
even want to look at them!"

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:11.240
Even if you hate it, gobble 
it down 3 times or 4 times

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:12.670
and it'll be more and more

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.010
Yuuuu... Toriko!

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:16.810
Eat 'em up more! Eat 'em up more!

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:19.680
More and more and more and 
more and more! Eat 'em all up!

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:23.950
Delicious things are delicious!  
Not even giving them a chance…

00:21:23.950 --> 00:21:25.290
Such a waste!

00:21:25.290 --> 00:21:28.120
Gobble 'em down more! Gobble 'em down more!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.930
Majorly, deeply, plentifully, 
heartily, gobble 'em down!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:36.530
They enrich your body and spirit! 
Be grateful to your meals today!

00:21:36.530 --> 00:21:39.430
Thanks for the food! All done!

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.170
Dishing with Tina!

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:47.210
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.450
For today's segment, I'd like to do 
something called "The Miracle Three".

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:56.480
Our guest is Oban-san, the 
vice-chief at Honey Prison.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:00.250
I am Oban.

00:22:00.920 --> 00:22:02.520
S-Scary...

00:22:02.990 --> 00:22:04.060
I often hear that.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:07.860
But please have peace of mind. 
I'm not going to execute you.

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:14.130
The Miracle Three!

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:18.170
We put our heart and soul into transforming 
Oban-san with makeup and costumes,

00:22:18.170 --> 00:22:20.540
then had a heaping helping 
of fun taking photos!

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:22.240
Now I'd like to unveil them!

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:23.740
The first photo...

00:22:28.510 --> 00:22:29.980
Cool!

00:22:32.650 --> 00:22:33.750
On to the second one...

00:22:38.720 --> 00:22:39.960
Cool!

00:22:43.030 --> 00:22:44.200
And the third photo!

00:22:51.800 --> 00:22:52.900
What's this?

00:22:53.510 --> 00:22:55.670
I like this one best.

00:22:56.470 --> 00:22:57.210
Seriously?!

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:04.880
O-On to the next segment...

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:08.860
Zebra and Komatsu form a new team!

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:10.890
And a strange duo shows up with Mansam.

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:12.670
Look forward to more astonishing scoops!

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:16.930
The Truth Revealed! Komatsu's Will and 
the Identity of the Mysterious Creature!

00:23:17.390 --> 00:23:19.120
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
